        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a628"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts3">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You need a tissue?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a629"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts4" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts5">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Alright.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a630"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts6" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts13">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If for some reason I lost all of my memory, what would be the first thing you'd tell me about us?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a631"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts20" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts21">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts38" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts53">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>One of them's definitely gotta be... You know that road trip we had? We went all the way up and down the coast, California. That was awesome. That was really cool.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a636"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts60" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts69">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's one of them. Second one's probably gotta be Wyoming. Because that was awesome. That was really cool. And then third one.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a637"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts72" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts73">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a6"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts75" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts103">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Third one kinda lasts for like a a while because are you crying already? Um and then third one's gotta be, you know, when we were looking up at the stars at our old place. Remember? We always come onto the roof and we look at from the roof deck.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a8"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts109" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts121">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Apartment apartment. Well, hot tub and apartment are tied because that's just, it was awesome. It's really cool. Awesome. Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
