        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a650"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts148" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts150">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was trying to not cry through every question and answer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a651"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts155" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts157">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I would tell you that we have an amazing special father son relationship. That you are extraordinary soul. It always have been since you were little.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a653"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts160" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts166">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you're a spiritual kid. So like</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a654"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts168" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts193">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I can talk to you about spirituality, meta stuff, and you get it. That you're a really smart kid, you do great in school, great athlete, and uh... you have a slight attitude problem sometimes where you are a little bit, uh... you get in your own way and you get a little, you get a little bullish. But, um, and that I also tend to just make every single thing a teachable moment, which is probably exhausting for you, but I love you and we have a great time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a659"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts198" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts199">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>All right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a660"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts203">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Ok, how do you describe me to others? How do you describe me to others?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a676"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts215" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts216">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>This been great.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a680"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts218" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts219">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Almost cried on that one.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a681"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts221" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts223">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Tears are right there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a685"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts234" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts235">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's a great one.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a686"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts240" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts242">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>This kid's gonna push your buttons with a level of.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a687"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts246" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts256">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think I'm right about everything that is a mirror for my own sense of like, I think I'm right. You know, I used to think I was right about everything, and I had to.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a688"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts257" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts260">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a689"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts262" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts270">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And now I'm like, I'm probably right about nothing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a692"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts274" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts280">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like the older I get, the more I real and the more I learn, the more I learn, the less that I know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a693"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts283" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts285">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Does that make sense?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a695"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts288" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts290">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>There's just so much to learn, so much to know. And I just thought that I knew it all. So you kind of...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a697"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts293" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts295">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>remind me of that part of me sometimes. Other than your sort of, uh...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a699"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts298" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts320">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Panic kind of feeling that can happen for you. I think you're way more chill than I was at your age. So I would be giving myself advice that you're going to be raising a kid who can be like, you know, stubborn and push your buttons and think he's right and like make me angry, which I've learned. I've gotten better at that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a700"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts325" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts338">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh, but also a kid who's like just gonna be awesome. So much fun. And um... I'm gonna be really proud of you. But I knew that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a702"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts342" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts346">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What is one experience you wish I never had and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a704"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts376" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts377">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'd be dead.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a708"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts392" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts393">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's an amazing answer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a709"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts398" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts405">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's funny because I immediately was like, oh, clearly the experience he's going to wish that I never had was getting ALS.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a710"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts411" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts412">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a711"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts417" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts422">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then as soon as I saw you pause, I was like:</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a713"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts424" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts425">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>but we learned a lot.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a714"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts429" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts435">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And without it, but I still wish I never got it. I wish that I learned all this without it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a716"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts446" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts447">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a719"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts456" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts457">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean, not much.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a720"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts460" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts463">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'm hesitant to talk to you about how hard this can be.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a721"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts466" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts467">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And like...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a722"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts469" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts476">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I used to think in my life when there were challenges and things and life was hard that complaining about it,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a723"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts480" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts486">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>talking about it was the only way to like get the feelings out.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a724"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts490" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts492">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You get'em out and you're just complaining.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a727"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts495" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts497">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You’re a victim.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a728"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts501" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts503">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right? And... We're trying to go from... feeling like a victim to this thing which makes you feel helpless and hopeless and whatever, to feeling like, no, it's victory. We're gonna beat it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a730"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts504" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts507">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we are or it’s already done, right? And we do that together. And I don't particularly like energy in my life from sympathy and pity around stuff like this. It doesn't help me heal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a731"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts510" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts513">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I need people to listen to me. I need love. I need to feel safe, right?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a733"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts514" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts516">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That’s why I didn't talk about it with you guys for a year and a half.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a734"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts520" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts522">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because what were you gonna do? While I- it wasn't obvious to anybody that I was dealing with this, right? And if you saw me having some problems, I just said I had a problem with my, my nerves, which is true.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a735"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts525" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts532">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I was like, I'm just going to deal with this. Because if you put a label on something immediately, this is what doctors do.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a737"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts536" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts544">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right? It's their job. They give you a quote diagnosis and then you go get a second opinion.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a738"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts548" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts550">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, that means the diagnosis is a first opinion.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a739"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts552" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts553">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So it's an opinion.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a740"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts555" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts556">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But people take these opinions on</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a741"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts557" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts558">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>and they identify with them and then they go, that's it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a742"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts559" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts560">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I was like, I don't wanna do that with you and your brother and have years of our lives spent with you guys scared and worrying.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a745"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts562" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts565">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Also, we had just come out of a pandemic,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a746"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts566" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts571">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>so we're gonna go from a divorce to a pandemic to your dad getting a thing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a749"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts572" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts576">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was like, no you do not need to know about that. Because the last thing I wanted to do was be a burden on you guys and have you feel any of the crap and you know, heavy, sad heart, whatever.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a756"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts577" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts579">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn't want you being scared about me 'cause life's hard enough.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a757"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts582" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts584">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But you guys don't seem like you are.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a758"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts587" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts588">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'm very impressed at how you and your brother have stepped up. How much you help, how much you listen now, you throw yourselves in, we do it as a family.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a759"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts592" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts598">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Just makes it easier. And then it's not that big of a deal.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a763"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts603" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts605">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like it's a lot.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a764"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts608" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts612">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I wish it was not.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a766"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts616" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts620">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And God willing, I'll be healed up.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a767"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts626" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts636">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we'll look back on this time and go, "You remember?" And we'll be so much stronger.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a769"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts637" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts640">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So much wiser.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a773"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts658" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts659">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Alright. What turn is it?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a774"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts662" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts665">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Last one, boi.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a775"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts668" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts669">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What does my love feel like?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a776"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts678" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts679">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's huge.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a780"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts712" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts713">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's a beautiful answer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a781"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts722" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts723">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Just a little bit.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a783"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts737" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts738">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Never forget about...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a784"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts739" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts741">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I never want you to forget...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a785"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts742" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts744">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We were kind of just talking about it. It's another way of saying it. I never want you to forget...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a786"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts745" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts746">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> to believe in yourself.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a787"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts748" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts749">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a788"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts750" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts751">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because when I forgot that,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a791"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts754" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts760">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I guess the simpler but more meta way of saying it is I never want you to forget yourself, who you really are.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a792"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts766" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts768">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>This whole experience has been uh</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a793"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts770" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts772">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>an opportunity for me to remember who I really am.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
