                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts812" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts850">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>A place of hope and possibility and love and joy and peace because that's who we really are. And the rest of the life that spins and storms around and stuff just tries to make you think you're something else. Makes you think you're just my son, you're a student, you're a basketball player, you're a dad, you're a husband, you're an actor, and then you think you're these things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
